Error [E0763]: `*` marks an empty parameter zone
  --> tests/ui/param_zone_empty.jet:1:29
    |
  1 | fn connect(host: String, /, *) String -> host
    |                             ^
 Why: A label-only zone needs at least one parameter after the `*`
 Fix: Write the label-only parameters after `*`, or remove the `*`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0763
